  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| browser-sync | devDependencies | patch | `2.26.0` -> `2.26.3` | [homepage](https://browsersync.io/), [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>BrowserSync/browser-sync</summary>\n\n### [`v2.26.3`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/releases/v2.26.3)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/compare/v2.26.2...v2.26.3)\n\n**fixes**\n\n-   application/wasm support - fixes [#&#8203;1598](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/issues/1598) [`d60cd91`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/commit/d60cd916ff1c64a69fddaa5cd2ca1061f066266e)\n-   deps - ensure previous users of browser-sync-client are not affected by new structure - fixes [#&#8203;1615](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/issues/1615) [`0a2ff5a`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/commit/0a2ff5a25d9e5ca7df7b1ec63a235f76a220ada6)\n-   npm audit fixes across all packages - fixes [#&#8203;1618](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/issues/1618) [`9f3fea4`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/commit/9f3fea4d0bef39b31c45e14cba669483f6e65448)\n\n### [`v2.26.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/compare/v2.26.1...v2.26.2)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/compare/v2.26.1...v2.26.2)\n\n### [`v2.26.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/compare/v2.26.0...v2.26.1)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/BrowserSync/browser-sync/compare/v2.26.0...v2.26.1)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
